    "abstract": "Parts figure for the brake assembly installation covering the torque tube flange group, the wear indicator hardware and the hydraulic connection items on the main gear.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the parts of the brake assembly installation, in particular the torque tube flange group and the wear indicator hardware whose datum changed with the wear pin standard.",
      "figure_note": "The wear indicator at item 30 reads against the pressure plate on pre-modification brakes and against the torque tube flange on post-modification brakes. The two scales are marked differently, in percentage and in millimetres, and a scale fitted to the wrong datum will read plausibly and be wrong. Do not order item 30 without confirming the datum standard. Items 60 to 80 are the hydraulic connection group and are common to both standards."
    },
